{"id":"cf6601abc567a9ea","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-formula-induction.md","title":"Formula Induction Principle for","display":"thm-formula-induction — Formula Induction Principle for","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-formula-induction","aliases":["57-thm-formula-induction"],"display":"thm-formula-induction — Formula Induction Principle for","depends_on":["[[57-df-free-for]]","[[57-df-so-formula]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","[[57-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-formula-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-formula-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-formula-induction — Formula Induction Principle for"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8216e0b1a4cf9570\" href=\"?note=8216e0b1a4cf9570\" title=\"57-df-free-for\">57-df-free-for</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"433037f9b53db530\" href=\"?note=433037f9b53db530\" title=\"57-df-so-formula\">57-df-so-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (签名, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(P \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (公式上的谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;(P(\\varphi))\">\\(\\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;(P(\\varphi))\\)</span> (原子公式基始, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;(P(\\varphi) \\to P(\\neg\\varphi))\">\\(\\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;(P(\\varphi) \\to P(\\neg\\varphi))\\)</span> (否定封闭, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall \\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;(P(\\varphi) \\land P(\\psi) \\to P(\\varphi \\circ \\psi))\">\\(\\forall \\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;(P(\\varphi) \\land P(\\psi) \\to P(\\varphi \\circ \\psi))\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ \\in \\{\\lor, \\land, \\to, \\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ \\in \\{\\lor, \\land, \\to, \\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span> (二元联结词封闭, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall x \\in \\mathrm{Var}\\;(P(\\varphi) \\to P(\\forall x\\,\\varphi) \\land P(\\exists x\\,\\varphi))\">\\(\\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall x \\in \\mathrm{Var}\\;(P(\\varphi) \\to P(\\forall x\\,\\varphi) \\land P(\\exists x\\,\\varphi))\\)</span> (量词封闭, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}formula\\text{-}induction\">\\(thm\\text{-}formula\\text{-}induction\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}formula\\text{-}induction\">\\(thm\\text{-}formula\\text{-}induction\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AtFml\">\\(AtFml\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fml\">\\(Fml\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var\">\\(Var\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}formula\\text{-}induction\">\\(thm\\text{-}formula\\text{-}induction\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AtFml\">\\(AtFml\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fml\">\\(Fml\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var\">\\(Var\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}formula\\text{-}induction\">\\(thm\\text{-}formula\\text{-}induction\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\theta)\">\\(P(\\theta)\\)</span> 是集合成员谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in P\">\\(\\theta\\in P\\)</span> 的缩写，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}formula\\text{-}induction} \\vdash \\Bigl[\\bigl(\\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\; P(\\varphi)\\bigr) \\land \\bigl(\\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\; (P(\\varphi) \\to P(\\neg\\varphi))\\bigr) \\land \\bigl(\\foral